{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22479","headline":"岁晚 · 白居易","name":"岁晚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜降水返壑，风落木归山。\n冉冉岁将宴，物皆复本源。\n何此南迁客，五年独未还。\n命屯分已定，日久心弥安。\n亦尝心与口，静念私自言。\n去国固非乐，归乡未必欢。\n何须自生苦，舍易求其难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}